{\plain Our interest is in the numerator
 polynomial as we are finding the zeros 
of the transfer function. {We see that h}{\fs16 
\dn6 0}{ is the coeficient of z}{\fs16 \up6 
M}{, h}{\fs16 \dn6 1}{ is the coeficient
 of z}{\fs16 \up6 M-1}{, and so on. The 
vector v that we use in the root-finder 
polyroot is in the reversed order.}}
}
